  ├──────────────────────────────────┼────────────────────┤
  │ Correct bearer token             │ passes             │
  ├──────────────────────────────────┼────────────────────┤
  │ Wrong / truncated / empty bearer │ 401                │
  ├──────────────────────────────────┼────────────────────┤
  │ Any bearer, [38;5;153mREPORTS_TOKEN[39m unset  │ 401 (fails closed) │
  └──────────────────────────────────┴────────────────────┘

  [1mFor the dashboard team:[0m set [38;5;153mREPORTS_TOKEN[39m in the service environment and have the script send [38;5;153mAuthorization: Bearer [39m
  [38;5;153m$REPORTS_TOKEN[39m. Note the token is read from the environment per request, so rotating it doesn't need a code change —
